<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-WEST INDIES AND INDIA DRAW SECOND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES AND INDIA DRAW SECOND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The second test</p>
<p>between West Indies and India at the Queen's Park Oval ended in</p>
<p>a draw on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 296 and 299-6, India 436.</p>
</text>
